---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '临时进口';
const description = '首次在中国：分步准备指南';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/visa/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Visa & Entry
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🛂 入境和签证</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        First Time in China: Step-by-Step Preparation Guide
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">你第一次去中国之前需要做的一切，按时间安排。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读8分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">⏱️ 阅读4分钟</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>在旅行前2-3个月开始准备。</strong> <a href="/zh/visa/visa-guide/" class="text-brand-600 underline">检查你是否需要签证</a> first. Buy travel insurance. Set up VPN, Alipay, and WeChat Pay at least a week before departure. Pack a power adapter, cash (just in case), and prescription meds. Once you land, activate your SIM, connect to airport WiFi, and you're good to go.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 在本指南中</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#visa-documents" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛂 2-3个月前：签证和文件</a></li>
        <li><a href="#insurance" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏥 1个月前：保险和住宿</a></li>
        <li><a href="#digital-setup" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📱 2周前：数字设置</a></li>
        <li><a href="#packing" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🧳 1周前：包装和最终检查</a></li>
        <li><a href="#arrival" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛬 抵达日：第一步</a></li>
        <li><a href="#first-24" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">⏱️ 中国首24小时</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

      <h2 id="visa-documents" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛂</span> 2-3 Months Before: Visa & Documents
      </h2>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4"><strong>First, <a href="/zh/visa/visa-guide/" class="text-brand-600 underline">check if you need a visa</a>:</strong></p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <li><strong>50个国家</strong> get <a href="/zh/visa/visa-free/" class="text-brand-600 underline">30天免签证旅行</a></li>
        <li><strong>约27个国家</strong> have <a href="/zh/visa/mutual-agreement/" class="text-brand-600 underline">相互免签证协议</a> with China</li>
        <li><strong>55个国家</strong> qualify for <a href="/zh/visa/transit-240/" class="text-brand-600 underline">240小时（10天）运输</a> visa-free</li>
        <li>Everyone else needs an <a href="/zh/visa/apply-l-visa/" class="text-brand-600 underline">L旅游签证</a></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">您需要什么：</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-gray-700 text-sm space-y-1">
          <li>✅ 护照有效期至少为6个月（含2+空白页）</li>
          <li>✅ 签证（如需要）——在旅行前4-6周申请</li>
          <li>✅ 酒店预订和航班行程</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="insurance" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏥</span> 1 Month Before: Insurance & Accommodation
      </h2>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>购买旅游保险</strong> — medical coverage is strongly recommended (hospitals in China may require upfront payment)</li>
        <li><strong>预订您的酒店</strong> — use Trip.com, Booking.com, or Agoda</li>
        <li><strong>预订航班</strong> — use Skyscanner, Trip.com, or airline direct</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="digital-setup" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📱</span> 2 Weeks Before: Digital Setup (Most Important Step)
      </h2>

      <!-- VPN -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">🔒 虚拟专用网络</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2"><strong>在你到达之前做这件事</strong> — cannot be done easily in China.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1">
          <li>Install and test your <a href="/zh/life/best-vpns/" class="text-brand-600 underline">虚拟专用网络</a> on ALL devices (phone, laptop, tablet)</li>
          <li>推荐选项：NordVPN、ExpressVPN、Surfshark等。</li>
          <li>下载应用程序并在离开前订阅</li>
          <li>测试谷歌、WhatsApp、Instagram和YouTube是否通过VPN工作</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Payment Apps -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">💳 支付应用</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1">
          <li><a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="text-brand-600 underline"><strong>Alipay</strong></a> (required): Download, register with your international number, link your Visa/Mastercard</li>
          <li><a href="/zh/payment/setup-wechat/" class="text-brand-600 underline"><strong>微信支付</strong></a> (recommended): Download WeChat, register, verify identity, bind card</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- SIM Card -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">📶 SIM卡/eSIM</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1">
          <li>Book an <a href="/zh/life/best-sim-esim/" class="text-brand-600 underline">eSIM卡</a> online (airalo, Holafly) — activates when you land</li>
          <li>或者计划在抵达机场时购买实体SIM卡</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Essential Apps -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">📲 基本应用程序</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>地图：</strong> Apple Maps works, Google Maps is unreliable — Amap (高德地图) is the local standard</li>
          <li><strong>翻译：</strong> Google Translate (download offline Chinese), or Pleco (the go-to Chinese dictionary)</li>
          <li><strong>运输：</strong> <a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="text-brand-600 underline">Didi</a> (China's Uber) — download and set up your profile</li>
          <li><strong>沟通：</strong> WeChat (required for many things — restaurant menus, QR code ordering, paying)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="packing" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🧳</span> 1 Week Before: Packing & Final Checks
      </h2>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4">
        <li>Convert plug adapters: China uses <strong>A、I和C类</strong> sockets (220V, 50Hz)</li>
        <li>制作护照、签证和保险文件的数字副本</li>
        <li>Check your packing essentials — see our <a href="/zh/life/what-to-pack/" class="text-brand-600 underline">为中国打包什么</a> guide for a complete checklist</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="arrival" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛬</span> Arrival Day: First Steps
      </h2>

      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>连接到机场WiFi</strong> — most major airports offer free WiFi via SMS verification</li>
        <li><strong>激活您的eSIM或购买实体SIM卡</strong> at the airport telecom counter</li>
        <li><strong>兑换少量现金</strong> — 500–1,000 RMB for taxis and street food</li>
        <li><strong>乘坐机场快线、地铁或叫滴滴</strong> (avoid unofficial taxis)</li>
        <li><strong>入住您的酒店</strong> — they'll scan your passport for registration</li>
      </ol>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="first-24" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">⏱️</span> First 24 Hours in China
      </h2>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>用手机支付</strong> — scan QR codes everywhere, most merchants prefer it. See our <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="text-brand-600 underline">如何在中国付款</a> guide</li>
        <li><strong>测试您的VPN</strong> — connect the moment you leave airport WiFi to a trusted network</li>
        <li><strong>了解你的邻居</strong> — find the closest convenience store (7-11, FamilyMart, or Lawson)</li>
        <li><strong>下载Amap</strong> if you haven't — it'll save you on navigation</li>
        <li><strong>Eat</strong> — street food, local restaurants. Tipping is not expected in China</li>
      </ul>

    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📚 来源</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://en.nia.gov.cn/n147418/n147463/c183390/content.html" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">国家移民局——单边免签证政策所涵盖的国家名单</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/china/entry-requirements" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline text-sm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">英国政府-中国旅游建议：入境要求</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-6">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/visa/customs-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国海关条例</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">你能带什么和不能带什么进入中国</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/visa/arrival-card/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">如何在线提交您的入境卡</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">带截图的分步指南</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">How to Pay in China</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">完整的付款概览</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/airport-to-city/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">从机场到城市</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">主要机场的交通选择</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
